### ============================================================================
### File: docs/api-tests/04-inventory.http
### Purpose: Manual and automated HTTP requests for Module 4 (Inventory: UC-14 to UC-20)
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, Thunder Client, and IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@mygodown.com
@adminPassword = AdminPassword123!
@managerEmail = manager@mygodown.com
@managerPassword = ManagerPassword123!
@staffEmail = staff@mygodown.com
@staffPassword = StaffPassword123!

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Authenticate as Administrator
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authenticate as Warehouse Manager
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

### Store token
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Authenticate as Staff
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "{{staffPassword}}"
}

### Store token
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. [UC-14] View Inventory Overview (Staff Access - costPrice Omitted)
### Expect: 200 OK, paginated stock list, costPrice undefined for staff
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name viewInventoryStaff
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. [UC-14] View Inventory Overview (Manager Access - costPrice Included)
### Expect: 200 OK, costPrice visible to manager
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name viewInventoryManager
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. [UC-14] View Inventory Filtered by Warehouse
### Expect: 200 OK, items filtered to specified warehouse
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name viewInventoryFilteredWarehouse
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory?warehouseId=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. [UC-15] Check Product Stock Availability Across Warehouses
### Expect: 200 OK, totalQuantity and warehouse breakdown
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name checkAvailability
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/availability?productId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. [UC-15] Check Stock Availability with Requested Quantity
### Expect: 200 OK, isAvailable boolean flag
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name checkAvailabilityWithQuantity
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/availability?productId=1&quantity=10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. [UC-15] Check Availability for Unknown Product (404 Not Found)
### Expect: 404 Not Found, NOT_FOUND code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name checkAvailabilityNotFound
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/availability?productId=999999
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. [UC-16] Record Inbound Stock Movement (Happy Path)
### Expect: 201 Created, updated stock level and movement ID
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name recordMovementInbound
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "movementType": "in",
  "quantity": 25,
  "reference": "PO-RECEIVE-001"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. [UC-16] Record Outbound Movement - Insufficient Stock (422)
### Expect: 422 Unprocessable Entity, INSUFFICIENT_STOCK code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name recordMovementInsufficientStock
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "movementType": "out",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "reference": "OVERDRAW-ATTEMPT"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. [UC-17] Adjust Stock (Admin / Manager Only - Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, previousQuantity, countedQuantity, signed delta, reason
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adjustStock
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "countedQuantity": 150,
  "reason": "Quarterly physical cycle count audit"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. [UC-17] Adjust Stock - Missing Reason Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request, VALIDATION_ERROR code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adjustStockMissingReason
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "countedQuantity": 150
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. [UC-17] Adjust Stock - Forbidden for Staff (403 Forbidden)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adjustStockStaffForbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "countedQuantity": 150,
  "reason": "Staff attempt adjustment"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. [UC-18] Transfer Stock Between Warehouses (Admin / Manager Only)
### Expect: 200 OK, transferReference, sourceRemainingStock, destinationNewStock
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name transferStock
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 2,
  "quantity": 10,
  "reason": "Regional stock rebalance"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 16. [UC-18] Transfer Stock - Same Warehouse Error (400 Bad Request)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request, VALIDATION_ERROR code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name transferStockSameWarehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 1,
  "quantity": 5
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 17. [UC-18] Transfer Stock - Forbidden for Staff (403 Forbidden)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name transferStockStaffForbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 2,
  "quantity": 5
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 18. [UC-18] Transfer Stock - Insufficient Stock in Source (422)
### Expect: 422 Unprocessable Entity, INSUFFICIENT_STOCK code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name transferStockInsufficient
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 2,
  "quantity": 999999,
  "reason": "Excessive transfer attempt"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 19. [UC-19] View Movement History (Newest First)
### Expect: 200 OK, paginated movements sorted newest first
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name listMovements
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 20. [UC-19] View Movement History Filtered by Type (adjustment)
### Expect: 200 OK, all items have movementType: "adjustment"
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name listMovementsFiltered
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements?type=adjustment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 21. [UC-20] Monitor Low Stock Items (Staff Access - costPrice Omitted)
### Expect: 200 OK, items with quantity <= reorderLevel, deficit calculated
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name monitorLowStockStaff
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 22. [UC-20] Monitor Low Stock Items (Manager Access - costPrice Included)
### Expect: 200 OK, costPrice present for each item
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name monitorLowStockManager
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 23. Unauthenticated Access Rejected (401 Unauthorized)
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized, UNAUTHORIZED code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name inventoryUnauth
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Accept: application/json
